<title>USA: Inter-Tel approves 300,000 share buyback.</title>
<headline>Inter-Tel approves 300,000 share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Tel Inc on Tuesday said its board of directors approved a repurchase program of up to 300,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the shares may be purchased in the open market from time to time, depending upon market conditions. Inter-Tel has about 13 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;The decision was made in view of the prices at which the company's common stock has recently traded, which we believe do not reflect the true long-term value of the company,&quot; Chief Executive Officer Steven Mihaylo said.</p>
</text>
